      "en": "Separation of gases or vapours; Recovering vapours of volatile solvents from gases; Chemical or biological purification of waste gases, e.g. engine exhaust gases, smoke, fumes, flue gases or aerosols(recovery of volatile solvents by condensation <b>B01D5/00</b>; sublimation <b>B01D7/00</b>; cold traps, cold baffles <b>B01D8/00</b>;  separation of difficult-to-condense gases or air by liquefaction <b>F25J3/00</b>)",
